    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "\n\n\n\n<p>You've picked up skills and tales from the Znir pact leaders. You gain the trained proficiency rank in Occultism and Survival. If you would automatically become trained in one of those skills (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice. You also become trained in Gnoll Lore. </p>\n"
